# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 ("A forwarded answer is this tick's input": the element the supplier places is the host's own at pos/[p]/0, and the World's first value and pushes for it are the child's place's, with no delay; a forwarding layer adds no tick and nests the path) and ch. 8 ("A new place's first value"; pushes are keyed by the element's value).
test jailed

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0]/0: Fs.Contents(path="/jail/motd")
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="inside")

tick 1
  in:
    Fs.Contents(path="/jail/motd") = ~ Contents(text="moved")
  changed:
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="moved")

test jailed_and_hosted

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0/[0]/0]/0: Fs.Contents(path="/jail/motd")
    0/[0/[1]/0]/0: Ui.Label(text="inside")

tick 1
  in:
    Fs.Contents(path="/jail/motd") = ~ Contents(text="moved")
  changed:
    0/[0/[1]/0]/0: Ui.Label(text="moved")
